{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794527686076,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd83e38ffeLH4Ot77Rgtkbk7","part":{"partID":"prt_1d22f6933002558ZnAwC3yrZQT","sessionID":"ses_e2dd83e38ffeLH4Ot77Rgtkbk7","messageID":"msg_1d22f4ff6001mICBOHpK2cfsQz","type":"tool","id":"call_228a3b46765540a5b2bb9ace","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\nSP=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch\nls -la \"$SP\" | head; echo \"---\"; cat \"$SP/socket-key.txt\" 2>/dev/null"},"output":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x@  8 michelkerkmeester  staff   256 Nov 13 00:53 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@  9 michelkerkmeester  staff   288 Nov 13 00:39 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff     0 Nov 13 00:24 .gitkeep\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 10 michelkerkmeester  staff   320 Nov 13 00:46 briefs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   312 Nov 13 00:53 cold-start-before.txt\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  7584 Nov 13 00:53 cold-start.mjs\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 18 michelkerkmeester  staff   576 Nov 13 00:46 logs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  2374 Nov 13 00:50 socket-key.txt\n---\n# Socket key: how the daemon socket name is derived\n\n## .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/skill-advisor-cli.ts (ADV)\n\n- `DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR = '/tmp/system-skill-advisor'` at line 31.\n- `ensureSocketEnvironment()` at line 1089 sets `process.env.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR` when it is unset (line 1091). It is called from the tool runner at line 1360.\n- `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: paths.dbDir })` at line 1363 derives the socket path, through the checkout's own bridge loaded by `loadBridge()` at line 244.\n- `paths.dbDir` is `<checkout>/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database` (line 229), unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\n\n## .skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs (LCH)\n\n- `createChildEnv()` at line 312 derives the daemon socket dir at line 336: `filtered.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = bridge.resolveIpcSocketDir('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir(), env: sourceEnv })`.\n- `resolveSessionProxySocketPath()` at line 1058 calls `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir() })` at line 1060.\n- `resolvedAdvisorDbDir()` at line 383 resolves to the checkout's `runtime/database`, unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\n\n## .skilled/bin/lib/launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs (shared derivation both call)\n\n- `resolveIpcSocketDir()` at line 139 and `getIpcSocketPath()` at line 162 joins `daemon-ipc.sock`.\n- `shouldScopeIpcSocket()` at line 103 returns true for `system-skill-advisor` when the socket dir resolves to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, or when `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`.\n- When scoped, line 152 hashes the canonical database directory with `sha256(dbDir).slice(0, 12)`, and line 153 joins that digest under the socket dir.\n- When the derived path exceeds the sun_path limit, `withinLimitOrRelocated()` at line 157 relocates it to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor/<sha256(intended dir).slice(0, 12)>`, still keyed by the intended directory.\n\n## Two checkouts\n\nThe scoped digest is taken over the checkout's own database directory, so two checkouts derive two different socket directories and start two daemons. An explicit `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR` other than the default skips that database scope unless `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`, so every checkout pointed at that same directory would share one daemon.\n\nper-checkout\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x@  8 michelkerkmeester  staff   256 Nov 13 00:53 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@  9 michelkerkmeester  staff   288 Nov 13 00:39 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff     0 Nov 13 00:24 .gitkeep\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 10 michelkerkmeester  staff   320 Nov 13 00:46 briefs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   312 Nov 13 00:53 cold-start-before.txt\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  7584 Nov 13 00:53 cold-start.mjs\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 18 michelkerkmeester  staff   576 Nov 13 00:46 logs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  2374 Nov 13 00:50 socket-key.txt\n---\n# Socket key: how the daemon socket name is derived\n\n## .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/skill-advisor-cli.ts (ADV)\n\n- `DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR = '/tmp/system-skill-advisor'` at line 31.\n- `ensureSocketEnvironment()` at line 1089 sets `process.env.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR` when it is unset (line 1091). It is called from the tool runner at line 1360.\n- `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: paths.dbDir })` at line 1363 derives the socket path, through the checkout's own bridge loaded by `loadBridge()` at line 244.\n- `paths.dbDir` is `<checkout>/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database` (line 229), unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\n\n## .skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs (LCH)\n\n- `createChildEnv()` at line 312 derives the daemon socket dir at line 336: `filtered.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = bridge.resolveIpcSocketDir('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir(), env: sourceEnv })`.\n- `resolveSessionProxySocketPath()` at line 1058 calls `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir() })` at line 1060.\n- `resolvedAdvisorDbDir()` at line 383 resolves to the checkout's `runtime/database`, unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\n\n## .skilled/bin/lib/launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs (shared derivation both call)\n\n- `resolveIpcSocketDir()` at line 139 and `getIpcSocketPath()` at line 162 joins `daemon-ipc.sock`.\n- `shouldScopeIpcSocket()` at line 103 returns true for `system-skill-advisor` when the socket dir resolves to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, or when `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`.\n- When scoped, line 152 hashes the canonical database directory with `sha256(dbDir).slice(0, 12)`, and line 153 joins that digest under the socket dir.\n- When the derived path exceeds the sun_path limit, `withinLimitOrRelocated()` at line 157 relocates it to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor/<sha256(intended dir).slice(0, 12)>`, still keyed by the intended directory.\n\n## Two checkouts\n\nThe scoped digest is taken over the checkout's own database directory, so two checkouts derive two different socket directories and start two daemons. An explicit `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR` other than the default skips that database scope unless `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`, so every checkout pointed at that same directory would share one daemon.\n\nper-checkout\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\\nSP=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch\\nls -la \\\"$SP\\\" | head; echo \\\"---\\\"; cat \\\"$SP/socket-key.txt\\\" 2>/dev/null\"}"},"time":{"start":1794527684915,"end":1794527686076}}}}
